      <memberdef kind="function" id="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_train_1a8b6c827ddc1fa5534da3bc3a92721715" prot="public" static="no" const="yes" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>storage::TTTrain</type>
        <definition>storage::TTTrain themis::tensor::HTTrain::toTTTrain</definition>
        <argsstring>() const</argsstring>
        <name>toTTTrain</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::tensor::HTTrain::toTTTrain</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Flatten the HT representation to a TT-train (memoized). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>On the first call, reconstructs the full dense tensor and re-decomposes it as a TT-train using <computeroutput>TensorTrainDecomposer</computeroutput>. The result is cached behind a mutex so subsequent calls return the cached value without recomputing.</para>
<para>Intended for compatibility with <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_i_tensor_index" kindref="compound">ITensorIndex</ref></computeroutput>; not efficient for large tensors on the initial call. Cache is invalidated when the <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_train" kindref="compound">HTTrain</ref></computeroutput> is move-assigned.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Stub #286 resolved: memoization behind <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_train_1a0d3c27fa54bdc15ebb2587eb93122830" kindref="member">tt_cache_mtx_</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_h_t_train_1a382bdff1e3a9ae31f498d363d24fc312" kindref="member">tt_cache_</ref></computeroutput> eliminates repeated O(∏ n_k) reconstruction cost. The long-term removal plan (Q2 2028) is to extend <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_i_tensor_index" kindref="compound">ITensorIndex</ref></computeroutput> to support <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1tensor_1_1_i_hierarchical_tucker_index" kindref="compound">IHierarchicalTuckerIndex</ref></computeroutput> directly, removing the round-trip entirely. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/tensor/ht_train.h" line="150" column="22"/>
      </memberdef>
